  Content: "Visit the Yukon Riverside Artist Market at the Picnic Shelter to browse
    original artwork and live demos from local makers. A vibrant space for creativity
    and conversation, this stop celebrates Yukon artists with goods for sale and
    warm welcomes\u2014come say hello and support art made right here!"
  RavenSucessScript: Picnic Shelter spotted! Prime perch, prime peckings. Caw!
